# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository and on every checkout, so a formatter or a
# script sees the same bytes on Windows (autocrlf=true) as on Linux CI. POSIX scripts must stay
# LF, otherwise `sh` fails on the carriage return; Windows batch files need CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf
scripts/* text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.md text
*.yml text
*.json text
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
